<description>
  <p>Music player whose visualizer moves with the music and with you.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Mini fits in a corner of the screen.</li>
	<li>Slim adds the track’s waveform.</li>
	<li>Standard shows the visualizer and the playlist.</li>
	<li>Full screen leaves just the picture.</li>
	<li>Spectramp reopens the way you left it.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Spectramp is free.</p>
</description>
